IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MINICACHE-DEPTH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 LAYER-IDX           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COMPRESSED-LAYERS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 KV-REDUCTION-PCT-X10 PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MINICACHE.
    IF LAYER-IDX >= 12
        MOVE LAYER-IDX TO COMPRESSED-LAYERS.
        SUBTRACT 12 FROM COMPRESSED-LAYERS.
        ADD 1 TO COMPRESSED-LAYERS.
        MOVE 415 TO KV-REDUCTION-PCT-X10.
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO COMPRESSED-LAYERS.
        MOVE 0 TO KV-REDUCTION-PCT-X10.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 KV-REDUCTION-PCT-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 COMPRESSED-LAYERS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
